# #189 Piece 2 (disc 508 D5(3)) — intent modifier on a local determination fact
library "Intent Coverage".

/*
An `absent`/`negative` intent modifier on a LOCAL determination fact (its concept has
`code is`) silently inverts membership: the ruled-out fact still carries the code, so
the concept would compute PRESENT (the opposite of the intent) in both lanes. Correct
negation is deferred (#257), so it is rejected loud (validator + CRE + emitter). Intent
on an activity/recommendation fact is legitimate and untouched.
*/

concept "Skull Fracture":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `skull-fracture`.
- definition is exists this.

decision "Coverage Determination":
first:
- when "Skull Fracture" then recommend activity "deny.skull".
- otherwise then recommend activity "approve".

activity "deny.skull":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Excluded: skull or vertebral fracture.`.

activity "approve":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with `Approve coverage.`.
